ds we found some pretty epic  carnival parties in the mom blogger  universe this party had a guessing booth  where she filled jars with candy and let  the kids guess how many were in there  there was a homemade ski ball game and  face painting the winners got to pick  from prizes at the prize booth other  party planners let the guests make their  own fishing poles with sticks strings  and magnets and then the kids try to  catch fish stuck to magnets for prizes  this one mother got creative with a  toilet paper toss into a hole that looks  like a toilet seat a giant sized  tic-tac-toe game and a sand art station  this is a party the whole neighborhood  will want to go to rock star party this  kid's mom made him a rock star for a day  and he was super stoked about it for  invitations he handed out handmade  backstage passes the kids made their own  guitar picks and got to play instruments  in a little rock star jam session this  party had a cake made in the shape of a  guitar fun labeled sodas with pictures  of the birthday boy on the front pop  rocks and a rock star cookies another  mom went with the glam rock world and  painted her child's face like David  Bowie  she had a bounce house a tattoo parlor a  photobooth and live music they had a  live band singing all of the birthday  kids favorite hits  they even made cupcake microphones with  ice cream cone handles when it was time  to sing happy birthday the band invited  all the kids on stage with their blow-up  guitars to jam out and sing all the band  played behind them making it look like  they were actually playing the song  truly epic and that was ten epic kids  birthday party ideas we hope you enjoyed  the video thanks for watching  [Music]

